{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-32684", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-32684", "text": "'}, raised its flag on '\n'$raised. An outlined square is a day it did not run. A clear '\n'strip is not a negative result: this is a screen on pulse '\n'timing, and it cannot tell an ectopic beat from a dropped beat '\n'from the band moving on your wrist.'", "sha256": "770490543ef7436311453791d7925a30822ce57c9e23403233a73c1043bbb4c7", "kind": "dart", "start": 32684, "end": 32985, "line": 722}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-35331", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-35331", "text": "'No resting breathing rate away from sleep'", "sha256": "2b4eddc95eb3f1b682c60878be96af525c999301e62cda106d83dad94685feb5", "kind": "dart", "start": 35331, "end": 35374, "line": 775}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-35440", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-35440", "text": "'This reads breathing only from three-minute stretches where the '\n'band saw you almost completely still, outside the sleep '\n'window. Most days have none — a day with none is a day you '\n'were moving, not a day anything went wrong.'", "sha256": "8022d5d81078406e5c31f6cad347e45f81dbae9a5462849b9805b545bc9f03cb", "kind": "dart", "start": 35440, "end": 35721, "line": 777}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-36481", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-36481", "text": "'Breathing at rest, awake'", "sha256": "4e795846bfcf905a9cf9320bf90dc13a38b4468dc71f6b3b38a38af29582dc6e", "kind": "dart", "start": 36481, "end": 36507, "line": 800}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-36576", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-36576", "text": "'Still stretches outside sleep'", "sha256": "972c5f9ca6157cafa200fda7b968cf6c9cf235c4c2aa389d533fa7f6e83f686a", "kind": "dart", "start": 36576, "end": 36607, "line": 802}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-36982", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-36982", "text": "'Next lowest'", "sha256": "0fb4c3ab82b66490913ebf5323b646e7f108f08c9750f3f430c744fcba771199", "kind": "dart", "start": 36982, "end": 36995, "line": 808}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-37091", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-37091", "text": "'Highest of them'", "sha256": "04df996f12d0211608379762b778e310bb86bdb894f2a99d030db9e436aaa8c6", "kind": "dart", "start": 37091, "end": 37108, "line": 810}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-37364", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-37364", "text": "'A floor, not a rate for the day. Only stretches where you were '\n'almost completely still can be read at all, so these are the '\n'stillest few minutes the band saw outside your sleep — nothing '\n'here describes the rest of your day, and breathing while you '\n'move cannot be recovered from beat timing.'", "sha256": "2ab78b31458caff91161d6514aba5c044c9113f964aa4289361db135e2deac88", "kind": "dart", "start": 37364, "end": 37724, "line": 819}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-38880", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-38880", "text": "'The cycle screen did not run for this night'", "sha256": "276aed45114316a895a370eb705a179c122a077cfd4ec981743ad437159ea739", "kind": "dart", "start": 38880, "end": 38925, "line": 852}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-39056", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-39056", "text": "'Not enough clean beats to run it.'", "sha256": "9fcb997111e78da423730efc2dfda2d6fee298d2fd4534a88e8757b87cdeb5eb", "kind": "dart", "start": 39056, "end": 39091, "line": 856}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-39836", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-39836", "text": "'Heart-rate cycles'", "sha256": "7a2d6bef742467d3132f671f333a9ad3e47b713ef64c1bb25db27290a418fb8e", "kind": "dart", "start": 39836, "end": 39855, "line": 876}
