{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-43310", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-43310", "text": "'Not enough nights for the across-nights view'", "sha256": "5d0e9d07899a1e29b222388d13803ba03e6f35db729384c9cf2a4f86600c65cd", "kind": "dart", "start": 43310, "end": 43356, "line": 944}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-43869", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-43869", "text": "'This needs several nights with a few observed hours each.'", "sha256": "55e26a854d79b038850c571a3016b0a36ac7aa7f7d6cf19f97e74c89833cc568", "kind": "dart", "start": 43869, "end": 43928, "line": 953}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-44164", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-44164", "text": "'${v.nightsExcludedIrregular} left out because the '\n'irregular-rhythm screen flagged them'", "sha256": "7bc085c73b49d6d77ca74f42a72310111cf5070855589c7f1525a70472691b4d", "kind": "dart", "start": 44164, "end": 44271, "line": 963}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-44380", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-44380", "text": "'${v.nightsExcludedThin} left out for too few observed hours'", "sha256": "4f62f3f9766f0d7da2696d451bce01e8a3cc0068609f1746b38a2a3956642dc0", "kind": "dart", "start": 44380, "end": 44441, "line": 967}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-44693", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-44693", "text": "'ACROSS $n OF YOUR OWN NIGHTS'", "sha256": "412820df20922c4431cafdc3293b30c51083d419a04ea7aefbb2c87bd759e4ad", "kind": "dart", "start": 44693, "end": 44723, "line": 976}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-44937", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-44937", "text": "'Over your most recent nights, the heart-rate cycling '\n'this screen counts has been running higher than '\n'across the $n nights behind it.'", "sha256": "1ac1a18259569254f21eddaa6e588256a15d443371237a223c2d8317c05c7d90", "kind": "dart", "start": 44937, "end": 45125, "line": 982}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-45202", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-45202", "text": "'Over your most recent nights, the heart-rate cycling '\n'this screen counts has stayed inside the range of '\n'the $n nights behind it.'", "sha256": "0f4177aa2aa7b279e338a6b02b8c4471f3ff1a0e62fe30d678498f9c086b6ef7", "kind": "dart", "start": 45202, "end": 45385, "line": 986}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-45579", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-45579", "text": "'It is a pattern in your pulse, not a measurement of your '\n'breathing, and it is not a test for anything. The same '\n'cycling comes from an irregular rhythm, from being at '\n'altitude, and from any broken-up night — and beta-blockers, '\n'diabetes and nerve conditions flatten it, so genuinely '\n'disturbed breathing often leaves nothing here at all.'", "sha256": "b6c3a2880eb0188f068b6af657fc1684b4da282e8c558af8059764057f529208", "kind": "dart", "start": 45579, "end": 46010, "line": 994}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-46211", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-46211", "text": "'So nothing here is a negative result and nothing here '\n'clears anything, and none of it says anything about any one '\n'night — a single night’s count moves for a dozen reasons on '\n'its own.'", "sha256": "cdecff293ff358312f3c61bc5dc757f31b8071f31fd29bf63e4de2d06073db4a", "kind": "dart", "start": 46211, "end": 46452, "line": 1005}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-46658", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-46658", "text": "'If you snore, wake unrefreshed, or someone has seen you '\n'stop breathing in your sleep, a clinician can test that '\n'properly.'", "sha256": "39f47f5798a7ba8b49bafe812f92459068f2a20a92f716e8599243c7543514a7", "kind": "dart", "start": 46658, "end": 46819, "line": 1014}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart:offset-48177", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/investigate.dart", "location": "offset-48177", "text": "'$exact min · shown as ${(i.loSec / 60).round()}–'\n'${(i.hiSec / 60).round()} min'", "sha256": "eb91cb0fb8003ccb00081784aaa49f4861bc4d9a12a6fcd7ab4f9446801de0ad", "kind": "dart", "start": 48177, "end": 48267, "line": 1051}
